  "snapshot": "thunderbird",
  "instruction": "Please export all contacts from Thunderbird\u2019s \"Personal Address Book\" to a CSV named contacts.csv saved on my Desktop at /home/user/Desktop, then open that CSV in LibreOffice Calc and save it as an Excel file named contacts.xlsx in the same /home/user/Desktop folder. Please use the standard comma-separated CSV export with the header row and default field order, and don\u2019t modify any data during the conversion. Source: https://www.sync.blue/en/sync/mozilla-thunderbird/google-sheets/",
  "source": "https://www.sync.blue/en/sync/mozilla-thunderbird/google-sheets/",
  "config": [
